MDL104, F1, F12: a valueless flag on the last line of a file without a final
newline never gets its "= 1" (the pre-processor only acts on '\n'), so GLib
rejects "routines" and mydumper ignores the whole file: no routines, and
users.email in plaintext, while the run connects through [client] and exits 0.
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.3-1
args: --defaults-file /work/defaults.cnf --database app
lint: MDL104, MDL405
expect config-loaded: false
expect exit: 0
expect connected: true
expect column app.users.email: plaintext
expect routines-dumped: false
-- defaults.cnf.esc --
[client]\nhost=mysql\nuser=e2e\npassword=e2e-password\n\n[`app`.`users`]\n`email`=random_string\n\n[mydumper]\nroutines
